### Create expense 1 - ₹1500
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payer_id": 2,
  "participant_ids": [2, 3, 4],
  "amount": "1500.00",
  "description": "Dinner",
  "expense_date": "2026-11-11",
  "note": "Team dinner"
}

