### Get group expenses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/3/expenses?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_4}}

### Get next page
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/1/expenses?limit=1&cursor={{next_cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_4}}

### Get group balances
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/3/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_4}}

