### Create settlement 1 : 3 -> 2 = ₹200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_3}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender_id": 3,
  "receiver_id": 2,
  "settlement_amount": "200.00",
  "settlement_date": "2026-11-15",
  "note": "November settlement"
}

### Create settlement 2 : 3 -> 4 = ₹200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_3}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender_id": 3,
  "receiver_id": 4,
  "settlement_amount": "200.00",
  "settlement_date": "2026-11-15",
  "note": "November settlement"
}

### Confirm settlement 1 : 3 -> 2 = ₹200 (id 19)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/settlements/19/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_2}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Confirm settlement 2 : 3 -> 4 = ₹200 (id 20)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/settlements/20/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_4}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Reject settlement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/settlements/{{settlementId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{actedByToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Cancel settlement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/settlements/{{settlementId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get group settlements
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/3/settlements?status=&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token_user_3}}

### Get next page
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/groups/1/settlements?limit=1&cursor={{next_cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{}}
